; The adapter is where the effects live: git, processes, files. The
; core in lib/ stays pure, and the lint that enforces it watches lib/
; and nothing else. The split is the point - a law about a value is a
; fact about the method, and a law about an effect is a fact about a
; machine.
(library
 (name mathcoding_adapter)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules git exec trail)
 (libraries mathcoding unix yojson))
